  "notes": "Gloamgarden sporekin: a mushroom cap over a petal skirt. The Tripo mesh was modelled turned 30 degrees; production (the round-1 candidate) already carries the faced bind, so a re-rig from it takes yaw 0 and the joints of the production rig (shifted by the intake's recentring), since the tip finder reads the cap's drips as hands. It casts (Spell_Simple): the overhand smash and the zombie claw fold the wide cap over the body. The petal skirt is a ring of spring columns (treant skirt) with leg and arm colliders; Hit is UAL1 Hit_Head, which starts near the idle instead of with the cap thrown back."
